{"parse": {"title": "交接日-03", "pageid": 123638, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%8E%A5%E6%97%A5-02\" title=\"交接日-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">交接日-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%8E%A5%E6%97%A5-04\" title=\"交接日-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">交接日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.9D.A0.E8.90.BD.E5.89.8D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"坠落前\">坠落前</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 坠落前</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Before the Fall</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">10:15 教学楼背面</span></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 10.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">教学楼背面</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“坏了，纪律辅员来了！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>男孩：</b></span>“快上去！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>两个孩子大约六七岁，他们见玛蒂尔达和拉文德出现立刻慌了神，手忙脚乱地向上爬去。<br />\n——不是校外活动日吗？怎么还有学生在？他们去教学楼里做什么？<br />\n玛蒂尔达来不及思考这些，因为她见到落在下面的那个男孩在慌乱中一脚踩空——<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“他要掉下来了！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><b>出手的时机转瞬即逝</b>。课堂上学过的咒语蹿到玛蒂尔达的嘴边——<br />\n<small style=\"color: #999;\">释放神秘术“悬浮定止”</small>\n</p>\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"及时释放\">及时释放</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"未能及时释放\">未能及时释放</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"及时释放\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #bc9567; padding: 0 5px;\"><big><b>解锁彼时所得Ⅱ“悬浮定止！”</b></big></span><br /></div>\n<p>男孩悬停在了半空，随后被缓缓放在柔软的草坪上。他的小脸吓得煞白。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“呼……幸好在这里的是玛蒂尔达，否则后果不堪设想！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"未能及时释放\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“悬浮、定——”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>坏消息，她慢了半拍。<br />\n在课堂上不费吹灰之力就能念出的咒语，此刻却在舌尖打了结，男孩眼见着就要一头栽下去——<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"不！\">不！</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"这绝不行！\">这绝不行！</div></div>\n<div>\n</div></div>\n<p>情急之下，玛蒂尔达向前奋力一跃。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“诶哟！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“玛蒂尔达小姐！您……没事吧？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达腾不出力气回应。她让怀里的男孩先行起身，抽着气又在地上打了两个滚才爬起来。<br />\n坏消息，她猜自己的脑袋上恐怕肿了一个包；好消息——没人在她面前摔破脑袋。<br />\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<p>然而玛蒂尔达似乎放心得太早了。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“小石头！你没事吧——诶诶！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>见同伴摔下墙，仍挂在墙上的女孩心急如焚地向下张望，却因此失了平衡。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“啊！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>她摔了下来——这一次玛蒂尔达来不及反应。<br />\n完了。她的脑海中闪过绝望。<br />\n但随即传来的并不是一声让人胆颤的闷响，又或是女孩的哭嚎声，而是一个有些耳熟的嗓音。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_11.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 11.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/Rolestory_madierda_pic_11.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"113\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/Rolestory_madierda_pic_11.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/Rolestory_madierda_pic_11.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"489\" data-file-height=\"504\" /></a></div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>？？？：</b></span>“——嘿！怎么回事？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>？？？：</b></span>“我只见过天上掉雨点和冰雹，没见过掉小孩的啊？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>女孩被接住了。\n那是一个身穿银白色铠甲的青年，没人看到他是从哪里出现的。<br />\n青年将怀里的女孩放了下来，她安然无恙，只是脸色有些发白。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“‘剃刀’小队？太好了！但你是怎么——”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>她说到一半，瞪着青年头盔下的面容愕然地张大了嘴巴。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“等等！你是——J？！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>J：</b></span>“好久不见，小家伙！没想到今天能碰见你。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“你怎么会在这里？你加入‘剃刀’小队了？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达惊喜地走上前去，好奇地打量青年那身亮闪闪的铠甲。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>J：</b></span>“还不算，只是先……那个词怎么说来着？对了，实习。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>J：</b></span>“过段时间‘剃刀’小队要在这里办一场宣讲，我们来提前熟悉一下场地。到时候还有一场实战表演，队长居然要我上……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>J：</b></span>“唉，承蒙队长赏识，但要我假模假样地比划，还不如真刀真枪放得开。真叫人头疼。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“会吗？只要拿出你平时那股耍酷的劲头来，应该是小菜一碟才对。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>J：</b></span>“不懂别乱说，什么耍酷？我那是作风如此，气质使然！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>不期而遇的重逢总是令人格外惊喜，二人笑着寒暄了片刻。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>J：</b></span>“——也就是说，你这小家伙也成了别人的前辈啦？不错嘛！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>他看了一眼安静站在玛蒂尔达身后的拉文德，拍了拍玛蒂尔达的肩膀。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>J：</b></span>“既然如此——做个好榜样，小家伙！”<br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 10.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<p>青年挥挥手后潇洒离去。现在，该干正事了。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“你们两个知不知道刚才有多危险！说说吧，为什么要偷偷进教学楼？是要去布置什么恶作剧，还是去做什么？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>两个孩子闻言交换了一个眼神。<br />但无论玛蒂尔达如何询问，他们都支支吾吾地不愿回答。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“你们知不知道按照校规，这可是要——可是要……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达迟迟没能狠心说出口，身后的拉文德却给两个孩子做了无情的宣判。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“是要关禁闭室的。”\n</p></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "交接日-03"}}